So the cleanest proposal: place by the Source field (already exactly one per section), but split the two largest into two categories each to reach six, OR keep 4 and add 2 by another axis. But "exactly one" must hold. If we add a different axis, a section could fit two. So the safest: a single axis = Source, but refine it.

