- instruction **at/after** handoff (orchestration/monitoring): guard suite red during parallel build, runner edited while it ran, criteria marked late, harness refused findings file, malformed doctor row, health script wrote HOME, export bundle lacked file, reviewer found guard-JSON incomplete.

